  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29301001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "小莉可，你这是在等人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "怎么又是你这个麻烦的家伙……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "还有……我才不是小莉可，要叫本王莉可魔王大人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好的，小莉可，我知道了，小莉可。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……算了，本王懒得跟你说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所以说小……莉可你是在等人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "哼，本王才不会浪费时间等一些无聊的家伙。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "所以说，如果是不无聊的家伙，莉可就愿意浪费时间去等了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "当然不会！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是吗。那莉可你觉得我算是无聊的人吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你……问这个问题干嘛？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "你不会以为本王是在等你吧……这，这是绝对不可能的事情！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哦，这倒是可惜了，不过……莉可你果然是在等什么人吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "……你！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29301015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "本王不要跟你说话了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
